sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Simulator
  participant K as Kafka broker
  participant I as ingest (group)
  participant ST as state
  Note over K: broker killed (chaos test)
  S->>K: produce fails
  S->>S: franz-go buffers up to MaxBufferedRecords, retries with backoff
  I->>K: fetch fails, consumer keeps last committed offset
  Note over K: broker restarts, log intact (acks=all, fsync)
  S->>K: buffered records flushed in order per partition
  K->>I: rebalance, resume from committed offset (at-least-once)
  I->>I: duplicates from re-delivery removed by Bloom / unique index
  I->>K: telemetry.canonical
  K->>ST: lag drains, seq-monotonic writes ignore stale replays
